<title>EL SALVADOR: SOCCER-EL SALVADOR BEAT PANAMA 3-2 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EL SALVADOR BEAT PANAMA 3-2 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SAN SALVADOR 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador beat Panama</p>
<p>3-2 (halftime 1-1) in a CONCACAF semi-stage group two World</p>
<p>Cup qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>El Salvador - Raul Diaz Arce (43rd minute), Wilfredo</p>
<p>Iraheta (68th), Geovani Trigueros (88th)</p>
<p>Panama - Jorge Dely Valdez (12th and 86th)</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p>Group two</p>
<p> Canada	   5  4  1  0  8  1 13</p>
<p> El Salvador    4  2  1  1  9  4  7</p>
<p> Cuba	     4  1  0  3  3 10  3</p>
<p> Panama	   5  0  2  3  5 10  2</p>
<p>Next match: Dec 1 - El Salvador v Cuba</p>
<p>Note: top two teams qualify for the final CONCACAF</p>
<p>qualifying round.</p>
</text>
